/**
 * Destroy a tracked session entity by its record ID.
 *
 * Hard deletes a session from discussion_board_user_sessions using its PK.
 * Recording the action in the audit log is mandatory for security and
 * compliance. Operation is restricted to admin role. Throws 404 if the session
 * does not exist. No use of native Date type – all dates are ISO strings with
 * branding.
 *
 * @param props - Object containing: admin - Authenticated admin payload
